      "description": "Locked or unseen things as dashed ghost cells; reached ones lit in the band and accent, with the stamp.",
      "html": "<ul class=\"ds-cells\" style=\"--ac:#ffb074;--band:#4f3524\"><li><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-cell\" data-on=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-mark\"></span>HexedCore</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" class=\"ds-cell\" data-on=\"false\"><span class=\"ds-mark\"></span>Tower Defence</a></li></ul>",
      "css": ".ds-cells{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px;margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none;max-width:360px}.ds-cell{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:10px;min-height:96px;padding:10px;font-family:var(--font-display),Tektur,sans-serif;font-weight:600;color:#b0b6c6;text-decoration:none;border:1px dashed #555b70;transition:background-color .3s,border-color .3s,color .3s}.ds-cell:hover{color:#eef0f5;border-color:var(--ac)}.ds-cell:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #ffd37f;outline-offset:2px}.ds-mark{width:32px;height:32px;background:currentColor;opacity:.3}.ds-cell[data-on=true]{color:var(--ac);background:var(--band);border:1px solid var(--ac)}.ds-cell[data-on=true] .ds-mark{opacity:1;animation:ds-stamp .6s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}@keyframes ds-stamp{from{transform:scale(1.6) rotate(-8deg);filter:brightness(2.4)}}@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-cell,.ds-cell .ds-mark{animation:none;transition:none}}"
    },
